        "A Tumkur-connected DP student generally feels the squeeze in a fairly predictable order: Class 11 internal exams first, then a stretch of Internal Assessment deadlines through Class 12, predicted grades locked in that autumn for university applications, and mock exams just before the real thing in May. Getting a tutoring plan moving by April or July of Class 11, soon after a Bengaluru enrolment or an online DP's first term, leaves enough runway to actually fix things.",
